{"id":"en_the-wolfless-queen","title":"The Wolfless Queen","titleEn":"The Wolfless Queen","description":"At just ten years old, Selene Ward destroyed her own wolf soul to rescue Tristan, the future Alpha of Dark Moon. For the eight years that followed, she bore the taunts of being \"wolfless,\" holding on to his vow that she would become his Luna. That promise died at his coronation, where he pinned her down as his new girlfriend sliced off her hair with silver scissors, then publicly rejected their mate bond in front of a thousand onlookers. Selene accepted the rejection, cut her pack ties, and left, accompanied by her father, Dark Moon's head warrior. What nobody realized was that losing Tristan would stir a dormant bloodline within her. At Apex Royal Academy she encounters Ryker Thorne, a supposedly worthless playboy who in truth conceals the strength of a pureblood Lycan king, and she finds","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-wolfless-queen/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-wolfless-queen/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Strong Heroine","Werewolf","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dii90/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-wolfless-queen_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dii90/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-wolfless-queen_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dii90/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-wolfless-queen_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dii90/?pub=4occak","kind":"emb